    "sourceUrl" : "",
    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1731061232344\" id=\"item-672dde8ba4c07b489aaa8175\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-f20b1a96624c41b64b34\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>About us: </strong>Property Media Japan specializes in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floorplans, and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">ey highlights include:</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Two Bedrooms</strong>: Well-sized rooms offering comfort and privacy.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Three Living Areas</strong>: Flexibility for a home office, family area, or media room.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Two Bathrooms</strong>: Modern finishes provide a refreshing daily retreat.</p></li><li><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Single-Car Garage</strong>: Secure parking with extra storage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Set on a low-maintenance property with easy access to nearby amenities, 21 Silver Moon Road offers an inviting, tranquil lifestyle in a sought-after location. Ideal for professionals or small families seeking modern comforts in a peaceful setting.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&